# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Confidential & licensed cyber datasets — NEVER commit the raw files.
# Keep manifests & .gitkeep files; the underlying data must be re-sourced.
# Exception: knowledge/datasets/benchmarks/*/*.csv are intentional example
# data (derived/curated) and ARE committed on purpose.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
